          "value": "<p>When Xyoddin deals damage with his jaws to a pinned or helpless foe, the victim becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 4}as Xyoddin consumes part of the victim's brain.</p>\n<p>A successful @Check[type:fortitude|dc:30] save reduces the effect to @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2}.</p>\n<p>A creature reduced to 0 hp by this attack is slain.</p>\n<p>Creatures immune to critical hits or with multiple heads are not killed by this attack.&nbsp;</p>"
        },
